sequenceDiagram
    actor Seller
    participant UI as POS web
    participant API as NestJS API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Worker as Outbox worker
    Seller->>UI: Checkout SKU and payment method
    UI->>API: POST /v1/pos/sales (Idempotency-Key)
    API->>API: Check seller + location permissions
    API->>DB: BEGIN / claim idempotency key
    API->>DB: Confirm current price and conditional stock decrement
    alt stock not available
        DB-->>API: 0 stock rows updated
        API->>DB: ROLLBACK
        API-->>UI: 409 OUT_OF_STOCK
    else stock available
        API->>DB: Insert order, immutable lines, payment, ledger, audit, outbox
        API->>DB: COMMIT
        API-->>UI: Committed sale / receipt number
        UI-->>Seller: Display / print receipt
        Worker->>DB: Claim outbox event
        Worker-->>Seller: Optional receipt email via provider
    end
